1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,721
Now the table from Unit 1 makes sense.

2
00:00:02,721 --> 00:00:09,348
The equivalence point is not always at seven, because the salt formed may hydrolyse.

3
00:00:09,348 --> 00:00:14,062
With a weak acid it is around eight point seven, so phenolphthalein.

4
00:00:14,062 --> 00:00:18,567
With a weak base, around five point three, so methyl orange.

